<PageLayout title="About TechOrbit" description="TechOrbit is an independent technology publication covering AI, smartphones, gadgets, apps and guides.">
  <p>TechOrbit is an independent technology publication. We explain AI tools, smartphones, gadgets, apps and online security in simple, clear English for readers in India and around the world.</p>
  <h2>What we publish</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>News and explainers about AI and consumer technology</li>
    <li>Step-by-step guides and tutorials</li>
    <li>Buying guides and product comparisons</li>
    <li>Plain-language security and privacy advice</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>We research each topic using several independent sources, write our own explanations, and list our sources at the end of the article. We do not copy other publishers' articles, and we never claim to have tested a product unless we actually did.</p>
  <p>We may use AI tools to help with research and drafting. A person reviews and approves every article before it is published. Read the full details in our <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Who runs TechOrbit</h2>
  <p>TechOrbit is published by the TechOrbit Editorial Team.</p>
  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>See our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> to send corrections, questions or feedback.</p>
</PageLayout>
